  "description": "The four best friends who graduated from the same girls' middle and high school receive identical sprout-shaped tattoos as a symbol of friendship. But this tattoo, it seems strange. Suddenly, they wither completely, and healthy leaves suddenly appear...?! A story about women in their 20s, each with different concerns about sexual desires and relationships, growing like a sprout transforming into a flower.\n\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/68522006), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%ED%94%BC%EC%96%B4%EB%82%98%EB%8A%94-%EC%9C%A0%EA%B5%90/4754)",
